      "judul": "Fans Spent $3.79 Billion on GTA 6. Here's Who Actually Got It.",
      "deskripsi": "After watching, you know who takes each part of an $80 GTA 6 download, and why none of it lands on launch night.\n\n0:00 The click\n0:37 The table\n1:31 Hand one: the state\n1:57 Hand two: the store\n3:03 Hand three: the card\n3:46 Hand four: the publisher\n4:33 The clock\n5:43 Is thirty percent fair?\n6:28 The split\n\n$3.79 billion is Take-Two's own estimate of day-one retail sales. Platform share figures, budget reports and card fees are estimates or reported figures. Tax depends on where you buy.\n\nSources:\nhttps://basic-tutorials.com/news/gta-6-sales-figures-3-79-billion-on-launch-day/\nhttps://variety.com/2026/gaming/news/gta-6-sales-billions-first-day-1236954198/\nhttps://www.tweaktown.com/news/94485/epic-may-pay-flat-30-fee-on-playstation-nintendo-and-xbox-with-no-reduced-split-for-fortnite/index.html\nhttps://gonintendo.com/comments/11811\nhttps://finance.yahoo.com/media-advertising/articles/gta-vi-launch-weekend-sales-190418068.html\nhttps://deadline.com/2026/11/gta6-first-day-sales-4-billion-1237230465/\nhttps://www.creativebloq.com/entertainment/gaming/rockstar-could-have-set-gta-6-at-any-price-im-not-mad-at-what-they-just-announced\nhttps://games.gg/news/sony-playstation-store-uk-pricing-lawsuit/\nhttps://www.invenglobal.com/articles/28728/sony-defeats-2bn-uk-playstation-store-class-action\n\nNot affiliated with or endorsed by Rockstar Games, Take-Two or any console maker.\nNarration, music and sound effects are AI-generated. Visuals are original animation.",
